All JSON data files in src/data/*.json (spells.json, subclasses.json,
backgrounds.json, species.json, feats.json) are compiled from:

1. D&D 2024 System Reference Document (SRD)
   - Source: http://dnd2024.wikidot.com/
   - Licensed under Open Game License 1.0a (see below)
   - ©2024 Wizards of the Coast, LLC; all rights reserved.

2. Wikidot Compilation
   - Source: http://dnd2024.wikidot.com/
   - Licensed under Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0
   - This compilation is licensed CC BY-SA 3.0

